			"Message": "fix(Grove): Correct Rust API Documentation URL to grove subdomain\n\nThe API documentation link `https://Rust.Documentation.editor.land/Grove/` did not resolve — the correct canonical URL uses the dedicated `grove` subdomain path `https://rust.documentation.grove.editor.land/`.\n\nUpdate both occurrences in the README (badge row and API Reference section) to point to the valid URL.\n\nAll external doc links in Grove's README now resolve correctly.",
