			"Message": "fix(Grove): Update Why WebAssembly doc link from why-webassembly to why-wasm\n\nThe existing documentation link at `/Doc/why-webassembly` does not resolve against RouteMap.json — the correct canonical slug is `why-wasm`. Update the reference in the Related Documentation section of the README to point to the valid URL.\n\nAll doc links in Grove's README now resolve correctly.",
